  "note": "The fix updates the native Brotli decoder the runtime bundles (decode.c, 1.1.1). Managed code reaches it only through BrotliDecoder: Decompress for BrotliStream and HttpClient's automatic Brotli decompression, the static TryDecompress for one-shot buffers. The packages are runtime packs, so the finding and these assemblies are in a self-contained service's folder; names checked in the 10.0.9 shared framework.",
